 trail=['Park at <b>Ekehaar</b>, Rolde or on the edge of Assen.',
        'Wet paths \u2014 <b>boots recommended</b>, especially in winter and spring.',
        'Managed by <b>Staatsbosbeheer</b> and the water board; within Drentsche Aa NP.'],
